282
00:21:20,020 --> 00:21:22,700
Trying to see if there was some small way to save you.

283
00:21:22,700 --> 00:21:28,920
While he was falling apart.

284
00:21:31,400 --> 00:21:35,320
However, changing what we see is very difficult.

285
00:21:36,440 --> 00:21:40,980
Even the slightest word or movement or emotion, any one of these things,

286
00:21:41,540 --> 00:21:43,380
they can alter the course of the future.

287
00:21:43,900 --> 00:21:45,560
